    {
      "kind": "callout",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "who have fallen ("
            },
            {
              "text": "physically and spiritually",
              "style": "italic"
            },
            {
              "text": "); You heal the sick ("
            },
            {
              "text": "both physically and emotionally ill",
              "style": "italic"
            },
            {
              "text": ") and free those in prison ("
            },
            {
              "text": "whether in real prisons or trapped in their own sense of limitations",
              "style": "italic"
            },
            {
              "text": "); and You keep the covenant You made with our ancestors. There is no other power like You at all; You have total control over our lives and our ultimate salvation. ("
            },
            {
              "text": "And that is why we are turning to You and only You with the upcoming requests in our Shemoneh Esrei.",
              "style": "italic"
            },
            {
              "text": ")"
            },
            {
              "text": "all",
              "style": "bold"
            }
          ]
        }
